msgctxt "80"
msgid "Yo! How's your condition? You know I'm always ready!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Oh, hey. I got some good info from a Coliseum regular..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Picking up your opponent and throwing him apparently\r\n"
"makes the crowd go crazy! It may be a chance to boost\r\n"
"your popularity!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"I hear that if you lose without putting up much of a fight,\r\n"
"it'll really damage your reputation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"In tag matches, it seems pretty important to use\r\n"
"combinations with your tag partner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"I bet working together to execute a finishing move would\r\n"
"really grab the crowd's attention!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "I'll tell you if I hear anything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"You really ought to try it. I'll tell you if I hear\r\n"
"anything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Even if you end up losing, you should still always fight\r\n"
"it out to the very end."
msgstr ""

